WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.040
Your members see one club. Behind the scenes, your team juggles eight different systems.

2
00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:14.394
Club Steward runs the whole club on one platform. Start with the core, membership sales and the members app, then add the modules each club needs.

3
00:00:15.694 --> 00:00:23.263
Your website sells memberships. Prospects explore plans and apply online, and every application lands in your sales pipeline.

4
00:00:24.563 --> 00:00:30.830
HR posts your jobs, ranks applicants against the role, and schedules your staff, who pick up shifts from their phones.

5
00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:39.299
Membership sales is core. Every prospect by stage, contracts signed in the platform, and no inquiry left behind.

6
00:00:40.599 --> 00:00:45.885
So is the members app. The club in every member's pocket, with their card, their benefits, and their bill.

7
00:00:47.785 --> 00:00:51.592
Tee-times, carts, and the pro shop all work from the same member record.

8
00:00:53.492 --> 00:00:57.904
Weddings, banquets, and outings run from the first inquiry to the final invoice.

9
00:00:59.804 --> 00:01:04.570
One point of sale for dining, the bar, and the pro shop, charged straight to the member's account.

10
00:01:06.470 --> 00:01:10.588
Your e-commerce store sells online, with orders waiting on the cart at tee time.

11
00:01:12.488 --> 00:01:17.759
Subscription billing and dues collect themselves on autopay, and anyone falling behind is flagged.

12
00:01:19.059 --> 00:01:25.460
Member service comes with a chatbot that answers on your website, and hands everything else to the right person, as a case.

13
00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:34.238
And the accounting suite posts every dues charge, round, and dinner to the ledger automatically, with statements by club and department.

14
00:01:36.138 --> 00:01:45.476
Add Active AI, and every flow gives real answers in real time, instead of canned responses. It plugs into everything, and you can bring your own AI.

15
00:01:46.776 --> 00:01:50.590
Each club's data is kept separate, and you decide exactly who sees what.

16
00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:57.609
Club Steward, by Ardn. Run the whole club, not a pile of systems. Book your walkthrough today.
